%% Sequence: WebSocket /ws/search used by the Web UI
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Web UI (app.js)
    participant WS as SearchWebSocket
    participant RP as llmPool / requestPool (chosen by SearchService.route)
    participant SS as SearchService
    participant O as Ollama

    U->>UI: types query, clicks Search
    UI->>WS: connect ws://host:8080/ws/search
    WS->>WS: handleNewConnection: context = {busy: false}
    UI->>UI: stage 1 active, "Expanding query…"
    UI->>WS: {"query":"car","limit":10,"expand":true}
    WS->>WS: parse + validate (same rules as REST)
    alt invalid JSON / query
        WS-->>UI: {"stage":"error","data":{"error":"invalid_json",...}}
    else a search already runs on this connection
        WS-->>UI: {"stage":"error","data":{"error":"search_in_progress",...}}
    end
    WS->>WS: route(expand): llmPool if expansion, requestPool otherwise
    WS->>RP: post(task), busy = true
    RP->>SS: expandQuery(query, deadline = arrival + 30 s)
    SS->>O: POST /api/generate (or fallback)
    O-->>SS: expanded terms
    RP-->>UI: {"stage":"query_expansion","data":{"original":"car","expanded_terms":[...],"status":"ok",...}}
    UI->>UI: stage 1 done, show term chips, stage 2 active, "Searching index…"
    RP->>SS: keywordSearch(query, expanded_terms, limit)
    SS-->>RP: SearchResponse
    RP-->>UI: {"stage":"keyword_search","data":{"results":[...],"time_ms":2.8,"total_matches":12747}}
    UI->>UI: stage 2 done, render result cards
    RP-->>UI: {"stage":"done"}
    RP->>RP: busy = false
    UI->>UI: stage 3 done, "Search completed."
    Note over RP,UI: All three frames are sent by ONE task in sequence,<br/>so the order query_expansion → keyword_search → done is guaranteed.
